{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":65,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["惩罚与拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“我向没有求问我的人显现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让没有寻找我的人寻见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对没有求告我名的国家说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我在这里，我在这里！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我整天伸出双手招呼那悖逆的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却任意妄为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不走正路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不断地当面惹我发怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在园中献祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在砖台上烧香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们坐在坟场里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宿在隐秘处。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们吃猪肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锅里有不洁之物做的汤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们对人说，‘站远点，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"别挨近我，因为我比你圣洁！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我被这些人气得鼻孔冒烟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整天怒火难息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，这些都记录在我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不会再保持缄默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要报应他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按他们和他们祖先的罪报应他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必按他们之前的所作所为报应他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们在山上烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在丘陵上亵渎我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“人发现一串葡萄尚可酿造新酒时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一定会说，‘不要毁坏它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"里面还有好葡萄。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同样，因我仆人的缘故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不会把他们全部毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“我必使雅各的后裔兴起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使犹大人兴起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"继承我的群山。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我拣选的子民必拥有那片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仆人必在那里安居。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙仑必成为牧放羊群的草场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚割谷必成为牛群休憩的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些地方必属于寻求我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于你们这些背弃我耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘记我的圣山、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摆宴供奉幸运之神、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斟满调和酒祭奠命运之神的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你们注定被杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都要丧身刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我呼唤你们，你们不回应；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我讲话，你们不聆听。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们做我视为恶的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"专行令我不悦的事。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我的仆人必有吃有喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却要饥渴交加；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仆人必欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却要受羞辱；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仆人因心里欢喜而歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却因心里悲伤而哭喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因伤心欲绝而嚎啕大哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的选民必用你们的名字作咒诅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华必杀死你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给祂的仆人另起名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，在地上求福祉的人都必向信实的上帝祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上起誓的人都必凭信实的上帝起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为过去的苦难已经被遗忘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从我眼前消失了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["新天新地"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，我要创造新天新地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"过去的一切都要被遗忘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从记忆中消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要因我的创造而永远欢喜快乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要造充满喜乐的耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城中造欢乐的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因耶路撒冷而欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的子民而快乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城里再听不见哭泣和哀号声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再没有只活几天便夭折的婴儿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有寿数未满便去世的老人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为满了百岁而终的人不过算是青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寿数不足百岁的人被视为受了咒诅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要建造房屋居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种葡萄园，吃园中的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们建的房屋再不会被别人居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们种的果实再不会被别人享用。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民必像树木一样长寿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我拣选的人必长享自己亲手劳碌的成果。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不会徒劳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们生的孩子也不会遇到灾祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们及其子孙是蒙耶和华赐福的后裔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们还没有求告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就已经应允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们正在祷告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就已经垂听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豺狼和绵羊必一起吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狮子必像牛一样吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛇必以尘土为食。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的整个圣山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们都不伤人，不害物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/65.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/64.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}